Sim Iluvatar CoreX adapter metadata
===================================

The Rust adapter, provenance-blocked ABI manifest, packaging scripts, and Nix
metadata are part of Sim and are licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

Iluvatar CoreX IXUCA, IXRT, IXBLAS, drivers, firmware, headers, runtime
libraries, and kernels are separately installed vendor software. They are not
redistributed by this package. A release may not bundle any vendor payload
without a separately recorded licensing approval.

The primary-source audit used the official Apache-2.0 IxRT OSS repository at
tag v4.3.0, commit 0528f3ae5da5dd2255f21966b82bedcb2de65582. That tree's
cmake/FindIxrt.cmake requires headers from a separately downloaded SDK, while
its ixrt/include entry contains only the text "../include". It therefore does
not provide the proprietary IXRT 0.8 or IXBLAS declarations required to review
symbols, signatures, layouts, or normalized header digests. Sim deliberately
keeps this adapter unbound until that evidence is lawfully supplied and
reviewed. Iluvatar, CoreX, IXUCA, IXRT, and IXBLAS are marks of their respective
owner; no endorsement is implied.
